Aged eight rising nine, I was institutionalised in an all-male boarding school, which fed us slop. What we didn't eat was scraped off our plates by the kitchen staff into large plastic bins, became pigswill to feed the local farmer's porkers, which were slaughtered, dismembered into ham and chops, sliced into bacon.
Pigs are super smart and intuitive. The only way to kill a porker humanely is to sneak up behind him, put a bolt in his brain before he realises what's happening.
Winston Churchill, who liked pigs, famously declared that a dog looks up to you, a cat looks down on you, but a pig treats you as his equal.
Orthodox Judaism and Islam share their doctrinal prejudice that pigs are unclean but will slaughter cows revered by Hindus.
